      "label": "Employed persons aged 15-74 (number and share) absent from main job (LFS) in the reference week (part of and the whole week) by born in Sweden/foreign born, sex and age. Year 2005-2025",
      "source": "Statistics Sweden",
      "updated": "2026-01-23T07:00:00Z",
      "link": {
        "related": [
          {
            "extension": {
